 ## What it is for
 
-The attestation stage is the signing boundary of the kestrel-yard pipeline. Everything upstream of it may
+The settlement stage is the signing boundary of the kestrel-yard pipeline. Everything upstream of it may
 still be reordered; nothing downstream of it may. That is the whole of its contract, and
 the reason the stage exists as a separate module rather than as a helper inside envelope.
 
